OL,5,G1800 The Lyric Feature
OL,6,     FAn exploration of the work of the
OL,7,     Fdrummer Eamonn Cagney who has
OL,8,     Fcreated new pathways for
OL,9,     Fpercussion in contemporary Irish
OL,10,     FMusic.
OL,11,G1900 Mystery Train with John Kelly
